---
interface Props {
  /** `keys` shows a slipped key becoming a word. `bar` shows the three suggestion-bar actions. */
  variant?: 'keys' | 'bar';
}

const { variant = 'keys' } = Astro.props;
const isBar = variant === 'bar';
---

{isBar ? (
  <figure class="typo-example" aria-label="Ba thao tác trên thanh gợi ý của Funput">
    <div class="example-heading">
      <span>TRÊN THANH GỢI Ý</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
    </div>
    <div class="chip-row">
      <div>
        <span class="example-label">GIỮ NGUYÊN</span>
        <span class="chip">“tpoi”</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="example-label">SỬA THÀNH</span>
        <span class="chip accept">tôi</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="example-label">HOÀN TÁC</span>
        <span class="chip undo">↩ tpoi</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption>
      Giữ nguyên và Sửa thành hiện khi từ chưa chốt. Hoàn tác hiện sau khi Funput đã sửa, cho tới
      phím tiếp theo.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
) : (
  <figure class="typo-example" aria-label="Gõ tpoi rồi nhấn dấu cách, Funput sửa thành tôi">
    <div class="example-heading">
      <span>TRƯỢT MỘT PHÍM, RA ĐÚNG TỪ</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
    </div>
    <div class="example-flow">
      <div class="example-input">
        <span class="example-label">BẠN GÕ</span>
        <div class="example-keys">
          <kbd>t</kbd>
          <kbd class="slip">
            p<span class="sr-only">, phím chạm lệch</span>
          </kbd>
          <kbd>o</kbd>
          <kbd>i</kbd>
          <span>+</span>
          <kbd>Space</kbd>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="example-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        →
      </span>
      <div class="example-output">
        <span class="example-label">FUNPUT SỬA</span>
        <p>tôi</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption>
      Phím p nằm cạnh o. tpoi không phải âm tiết tiếng Việt, nên dấu cách đổi thành tôi.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
)}

<style>
  .typo-example {
    margin-block: 32px;
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid #cbd4bd;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--sage);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .example-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 22px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd4bd;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }
  .example-heading > :last-child {
    color: #ba3919;
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .example-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding-block: 28px;
  }
  .example-label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #535d46;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }
  .example-keys {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 7px;
  }
  kbd {
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #c5cbb9;
    border-bottom-width: 3px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #fffcf4;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  kbd.slip {
    border-color: #ba3919;
    color: #ba3919;
  }
  .example-keys > span {
    color: #535d46;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .example-arrow {
    color: #ba3919;
    font-size: 28px;
  }
  .example-output p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .chip-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    padding-block: 28px;
  }
  .chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border: 1px solid #c5cbb9;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #fffcf4;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }
  .chip.accept {
    border-color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fffcf4;
  }
  .typo-example figcaption {
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid #cbd4bd;
    color: #535d46;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .typo-example {
      padding: 22px;
    }
    .example-flow,
    .chip-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .example-arrow {
      justify-self: start;
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      line-height: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
